<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Lucid Angel, 1993</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;In the summer of 1992, President Mohamed Boudiaf of Algeria was assassinated.&amp;nbsp; A&amp;nbsp;transitional government, backed by the military, took power and declared a state of emergency.&amp;nbsp; Thousands of people were arrested and, according to various human rights organizations, the use of torture by the government was widespread.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;This scenario assumes that, among those arrested, were several Americans.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Scenario written by Mark Gellis.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
